nnual penalty charges for full payment of dues.  Defaulters must declare their intent to pay by November fourteenth.  The scheme is valid until December fifteenth, aiming to recover significant revenue.  Property tax collection for 2024-25 reached six hundred nine crore rupees.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/ghaziabad-civic-body-launches-one-time-settlement-for-60000-property-tax-defaulters/133367418?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-142866/133367418.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}